text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">Built Salesforce environments to unify operations while preserving unique processes and commission structures for each brand.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">Organized the brands into strategic groups based on location and industry.<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">ERP Integration (JDEdwards):</span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">Integrated JDEdwards data into Salesforce, ensuring real-time synchronization and consistent data integrity.<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#E74D25;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Enhanced Operational Oversight:</span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n&nbsp;</p>\n\n<ul class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">Designed workflows that provided comprehensive, real-time views of operations without compromising brand autonomy.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>","skin":"WRichTextThemeSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"},"comp-m5y8xzuz4":{"fillLayers":{"containerId":"comp-m5y8xzuz4","ha